    fix(api): emit empty related problems array (REVIEW-OB-008)
    
    Go encoding/json marshals a nil slice as null, so both submit
    response construction paths (queued and deduplicated) emitted
    related_problems:null when relatedFor returned nil. Normalize nil
    to a non-nil empty slice via nonNilStrings at both sites so the
    published contract always emits related_problems as a JSON array.
    
    Regression tests lock the wire contract on both paths (key present,
    array value, never null) and verify populated related problems are
    preserved.
    
    Addresses REVIEW-OB-008.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
---
 internal/api/handlers.go      | 18 ++++++++-
 internal/api/handlers_test.go | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

